From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] apklayer compat: accept libunwind before 1.8

Ubuntu 22.04 ships libunwind 1.3; meson asks for 1.8.
Applied by tools/build bt only when pkg-config reports libunwind older than 1.8.
---
diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index d741726..0350835 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -53,7 +53,7 @@ dl_bio = shared_library('dl_bio',
 		dependency('dl'),
 		dependency('egl'),
 		dependency('libelf'),
-		dependency('libunwind', version : '>=1.8.0'), # needed by libc_bio anyway, so might as well use it here
+		dependency('libunwind', version : '>=1.3.0'), # needed by libc_bio anyway, so might as well use it here
 		config,
 	],
 	link_with: [
